// Brought to u by MidManStudio
// =============================================================================
// DIFF / COMPLETIONS / AUDIT COMMANDS + CLI TEST COVERAGE  ·  DixScript v1.0.0
// =============================================================================
// Everything mdix-cli gained from the "diff command" work onward:
//   1. New commands: `mdix diff`, `mdix completions`, `mdix audit`
//      (audit is read-only over .mdix.au — info / view / archives)
//   2. main.rs + commands/mod.rs + Cargo.toml updated to wire all three in
//   3. debug-tokens / debug-ast / debug-symbols grouped under their own
//      "Debug commands" help heading (still fully visible, not hidden)
//   4. Integration test coverage for: merge, decrypt, debug-tokens,
//      debug-ast, debug-symbols, diff, completions, audit -- all 8 had
//      zero tests before this
//   5. Three real DLM fixtures pulled from mdix_files/tests/dlm/ (keyfile
//      AES-256, diy audit, enhanced audit) for the decrypt/audit tests
//   6. mdix-wasm/tests/dlm_compression.rs -- gzip/bzip2/lzma coverage,
//      standalone + paired with encryption (web.rs only ever tested gzip)
//
// NOT included here on purpose:
//   - enum-plus-mixed-data tests (test_enum_mixed_data.py, the wasm/C#/npm
//     equivalents) -- already applied separately
//   - any .github/workflows/*.yml -- deliberately left out of this package
//
// Every replacement file below is a NESTED archive entry, so each one
// resolves straight to target_root + its own path -- no overrides:: block
// needed, nothing here shares a basename with anything ambiguous.
// =============================================================================

@CONFIG(
  version    -> "1.0.0"
  author     -> "MidManStudio"
  debug_mode -> "off"
)

@DATA(
  description = "diff/completions/audit commands + full CLI test coverage (post-diff-command work, enum tests and workflow files excluded)"
  target_root = "."
)
